# Internal panel DRM card.
#
# The vendor 99-cardputer-zero-lcd.rules assigned this card to its own seat
# (seat-cardputer-zero). kmscon and libseat run on seat0, and uterm_monitor
# drops every DRM device assigned to a different seat, so card1 never reached
# kmscon and it fell back to the panel's fbdev node. CPZ has no separate seat
# or compositor: keep the card on seat0 and keep only the stable symlink.
ACTION!="remove", SUBSYSTEM=="drm", KERNEL=="card*", \
  ENV{ID_PATH}=="platform-3f204000.spi-cs-0", \
  ENV{ID_SEAT}="seat0", \
  SYMLINK+="dri/cardputer-zero-internal"
